WEBVTT

00:00:02.100 --> 00:00:04.610
The three separated at a fork in the road.

00:00:05.160 --> 00:00:08.150
And now their whereabouts are undisclosed. Do they want to protect themselves, other people,

00:00:08.150 --> 00:00:09.830
or heavenly dreams?

00:00:10.460 --> 00:00:12.750
The creases of disorder are a cauldron of three.

00:00:13.500 --> 00:00:15.370
To an endless, eternal picture of Hell,

00:00:16.250 --> 00:00:19.500
pushing through time, a door is dispelled.

00:00:20.120 --> 00:00:24.860
Your grudge shall be released.

00:00:25.490 --> 00:00:30.430
A taxi driver got into a fight with a drunkard and suffered a serious injury.

00:00:30.430 --> 00:00:32.900
The one at fault was the drunkard,

00:00:32.900 --> 00:00:36.350
but that person was the son of an influential man in the city,

00:00:36.350 --> 00:00:38.000
so the police conspired with him,

00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:40.020
and the incident was concealed.

00:00:40.020 --> 00:00:42.040
It was Tsujino-bashi’s only son.

00:00:42.350 --> 00:00:43.530
In this city,

00:00:43.530 --> 00:00:45.910
there is no one that can go against the Tsujino-bashi family.

00:00:45.910 --> 00:00:51.530
The taxi driver’s daughter, Mayama Azusa, begrudged Tsujino-bashi’s son.

00:00:51.530 --> 00:00:55.810
However, the son, with his father’s power, escaped to another country.

00:00:55.810 --> 00:00:58.130
So instead, she begrudged the police.

00:00:58.360 --> 00:01:03.510
The one responsible for the concealment of the incident was the chief of the Saigawara police force…

00:01:03.510 --> 00:01:05.050
Akie’s father.

00:01:05.050 --> 00:01:11.190
So Mayama Azusa, to make Akie’s father suffer, sent Akie to Hell.

00:01:19.190 --> 00:01:23.960
To think that the person who sent that girl to Hell would be our first target…

00:01:23.960 --> 00:01:26.200
What a coincidence.

00:01:26.210 --> 00:01:29.590
No, she’s perfect for our first target.

00:01:29.590 --> 00:01:30.730
Who’s the client?

00:01:33.530 --> 00:01:34.540
Takasugi…

00:01:34.880 --> 00:01:36.530
Akie’s father.

00:01:36.810 --> 00:01:38.420
I see…

00:01:40.410 --> 00:01:44.810
Akie’s father doesn’t remember me anymore, right?

00:01:45.110 --> 00:01:47.010
Yes, that should be the case.

00:01:47.860 --> 00:01:49.430
Let’s go.

00:03:32.360 --> 00:03:37.860
This program is made possible by Sony Music, Aniplex,

00:03:38.240 --> 00:03:41.990
and the listed sponsors.

00:03:53.670 --> 00:03:55.280
Are you going?

00:04:00.180 --> 00:04:03.270
That girl became Jigoku Shoujo, right?

00:04:03.270 --> 00:04:04.020
Yeah.

00:04:04.490 --> 00:04:05.430
I see.

00:04:10.940 --> 00:04:13.010
Did you want to save her?

00:04:13.330 --> 00:04:15.850
That’s why you came to this city, right?

00:04:16.240 --> 00:04:19.540
I can’t do that.

00:04:19.910 --> 00:04:22.100
Then, why did you come?

00:04:22.400 --> 00:04:24.120
Who knows...

00:04:24.120 --> 00:04:26.040
Maybe I wanted to make sure.

00:04:26.040 --> 00:04:28.220
People who try to look strong are fortunate…

00:04:28.620 --> 00:04:31.230
You’re such a stubborn person.

00:04:31.230 --> 00:04:33.860
Yuzuki was relying on you.

00:04:33.860 --> 00:04:35.620
Couldn’t you have done something?

00:04:36.250 --> 00:04:39.200
What can I do, now that you tell me that?

00:04:39.200 --> 00:04:41.130
It has already ended.

00:04:42.060 --> 00:04:44.770
I can’t understand either.

00:04:44.770 --> 00:04:50.290
That girl, even after death, became a middle schooler like she longed to be, and remained in this world.

00:04:50.290 --> 00:04:52.940
I wanted to do something for her.

00:04:52.940 --> 00:04:56.570
But, something inside of me got in my way.

00:04:57.340 --> 00:04:59.060
Was it Hajime-chan?

00:05:08.490 --> 00:05:09.910
Goodbye.

00:05:10.220 --> 00:05:11.920
I don’t think we’ll meet again.

00:05:37.120 --> 00:05:38.730
Master?

00:05:38.730 --> 00:05:42.230
Haruko-san. You’re still awake?

00:05:42.230 --> 00:05:44.340
Are you okay?

00:05:44.340 --> 00:05:45.580
I’m sorry.

00:05:45.580 --> 00:05:47.960
Shall I get you some tea?{I was totally wishing I could use fetch in a script! fetch is fail! _anon1}

00:05:47.960 --> 00:05:51.460
No, I’m fine. You go rest.

00:05:55.340 --> 00:05:56.890
Leave it as is.

00:05:57.300 --> 00:05:58.890
Well then…

00:06:11.990 --> 00:06:13.570
Takasugi-san.

00:06:14.110 --> 00:06:15.210
Jigoku…

00:06:15.930 --> 00:06:17.070
Shoujo?

00:06:17.370 --> 00:06:18.990
Yes, I am.

00:06:18.990 --> 00:06:20.900
You came for me?

00:06:22.270 --> 00:06:24.990
Please! Release my grudge!

00:06:24.990 --> 00:06:26.290
Wanyudo-san.

00:06:26.290 --> 00:06:27.670
Sure.

00:06:33.740 --> 00:06:39.260
If you really want to release your grudge, pull that red string.

00:06:39.770 --> 00:06:44.310
If you pull the string, it would signify you agreeing to a contract with me, {lolz please reedit}

00:06:44.310 --> 00:06:48.020
and the one you begrudge shall be swiftly sent to Hell.

00:06:48.020 --> 00:06:53.570
However, if you release your grudge, you must pay the price as well.

00:06:53.570 --> 00:06:55.510
A price?

00:06:55.510 --> 00:06:59.710
Curse someone, and two holes are created.

00:06:59.710 --> 00:07:02.580
If you agree, your soul, too, will fall to Hell.

00:07:03.290 --> 00:07:05.490
Although that’s after you die.

00:07:06.990 --> 00:07:08.720
Hell, eh?

00:07:10.810 --> 00:07:14.940
It won't be painful compared to my life after Akie disappeared.

00:07:15.500 --> 00:07:18.880
I couldn’t believe that Akie disappeared.

00:07:20.260 --> 00:07:22.820
My only daughter.

00:07:22.820 --> 00:07:24.550
She was everything to me!

00:07:31.050 --> 00:07:35.610
I investigated whether Mayama Azusa had killed her, but nothing came up.

00:07:35.610 --> 00:07:38.440
Then maybe Akie is alive somewhere?

00:07:38.440 --> 00:07:41.870
With that in mind, I searched and searched…

00:07:41.870 --> 00:07:44.300
I ended up quitting my job…

00:07:44.620 --> 00:07:46.600
But I still couldn’t find anything.

00:07:47.530 --> 00:07:51.040
After I investigated the rumors surrounding me,

00:07:51.530 --> 00:07:54.060
I found out about the Hell Correspondence.

00:07:55.040 --> 00:07:57.240
And then I remembered.

00:07:57.780 --> 00:08:02.050
On the chest of Mayama Azusa was a crest of Hell.

00:08:03.210 --> 00:08:05.580
That woman sent Akie to Hell.

00:08:05.580 --> 00:08:07.240
Even though Akie didn’t do anything!

00:08:07.240 --> 00:08:08.830
Even though I was the one at fault!

00:08:08.830 --> 00:08:11.670
Even though she should’ve sent me to Hell, if anybody!

00:08:12.770 --> 00:08:15.830
The law can't pass judgment on it.

00:08:15.830 --> 00:08:17.520
Then I’ll…

00:08:18.180 --> 00:08:21.110
I’ll make her experience the same feelings as Akie!

00:08:21.110 --> 00:08:24.570
I’ll make her experience the pain in Akie’s heart!

00:08:26.020 --> 00:08:27.740
<i>Mother…</i>

00:08:30.170 --> 00:08:31.320
I agree.

00:08:31.650 --> 00:08:33.710
You shall pass judgment.

00:08:33.710 --> 00:08:35.750
For Akie’s sake as well, that woman…

00:08:37.410 --> 00:08:38.700
Where are you going?

00:08:38.700 --> 00:08:40.250
I’ll see it with my own eyes.

00:08:40.640 --> 00:08:43.380
The moment she falls to Hell.

00:08:43.380 --> 00:08:45.260
I’ll see it with these eyes!

00:08:45.710 --> 00:08:47.000
Yes,

00:08:47.430 --> 00:08:49.260
that is a good idea.

00:08:49.500 --> 00:08:50.440
You’re late!

00:08:50.440 --> 00:08:52.120
Hurry up and wind me, Waro-Waro!

00:08:52.120 --> 00:08:53.260
Yes, hime.

00:08:55.220 --> 00:08:56.430
What’s wrong?

00:08:56.430 --> 00:08:57.920
I feel itchy...

00:08:57.920 --> 00:08:59.270
Are you OK?

00:09:06.840 --> 00:09:08.380
Hime…!

00:09:30.200 --> 00:09:31.770
What’s wrong?

00:09:33.890 --> 00:09:35.230
Takasugi-san?

00:09:36.020 --> 00:09:37.820
I’m returning this.

00:09:40.750 --> 00:09:42.730
What do you mean?

00:09:42.730 --> 00:09:45.030
I cannot do it.

00:09:45.340 --> 00:09:46.820
Why?

00:09:46.820 --> 00:09:49.840
That woman sent your daughter to Hell!

00:09:49.840 --> 00:09:52.320
Akie had done nothing wrong!

00:09:52.320 --> 00:09:54.350
I hate her. I can’t forgive her.

00:09:54.350 --> 00:09:55.740
Then, why?

00:09:57.570 --> 00:10:00.750
That woman will fall to Hell anyway.

00:10:00.760 --> 00:10:01.740
Huh?

00:10:01.740 --> 00:10:04.030
She’ll suffer retribution.

00:10:10.580 --> 00:10:14.190
I don’t know what happened, but there’s no use.

00:10:14.190 --> 00:10:15.690
Let’s go home.

00:10:16.330 --> 00:10:17.730
I’ll send her to Hell.

00:10:17.730 --> 00:10:19.280
What?

00:10:19.720 --> 00:10:22.510
Instead of Takasugi-san, I’ll send her to Hell.

00:10:22.510 --> 00:10:24.670
Do you know what you’re saying?

00:10:24.670 --> 00:10:25.790
Let’s go.

00:10:25.790 --> 00:10:26.740
Hey!

00:10:33.100 --> 00:10:34.040
Ai.

00:10:34.500 --> 00:10:35.240
Ojou.

00:10:35.960 --> 00:10:37.020
Yuzuki.

00:10:37.360 --> 00:10:38.760
That is unforgivable.

00:10:38.760 --> 00:10:40.490
Get out of the way!

00:10:40.880 --> 00:10:44.470
There are rules to be followed as a Jigoku Shoujo.

00:10:44.470 --> 00:10:46.470
I accepted the request.

00:10:46.470 --> 00:10:48.340
That’s why I’ll send that woman to Hell.

00:10:48.340 --> 00:10:50.520
The contract has not been accepted.

00:10:50.520 --> 00:10:51.950
What about the contract?

00:10:51.950 --> 00:10:55.510
That woman sent the sinless Akie to Hell!

00:10:55.920 --> 00:10:58.090
Betrayed by whom she trusted…

00:10:58.090 --> 00:10:59.810
Poor Akie…

00:11:01.200 --> 00:11:02.840
This is your job.

00:11:02.840 --> 00:11:06.110
I have my own rules, so get out of the way!

00:11:10.440 --> 00:11:11.660
Ojou!

00:11:16.020 --> 00:11:20.250
I will release the grudges of those sinless people who were sent to Hell.

00:11:21.440 --> 00:11:24.140
Since I can understand that frustration.

00:11:30.280 --> 00:11:32.120
Are you okay, Ojou?

00:11:33.440 --> 00:11:34.640
Call everyone.{she doesn’t say "call" but it’s implied}

00:11:43.600 --> 00:11:45.230
Mayama Azusa.

00:11:46.260 --> 00:11:48.890
The time has come to atone for your sins.

00:11:50.900 --> 00:11:54.900
Even if you don’t remember, I will never forget.

00:12:00.850 --> 00:12:03.870
Would you like to die this once?

00:12:18.350 --> 00:12:19.390
Akie?

00:12:30.790 --> 00:12:32.900
You know, right?

00:12:33.360 --> 00:12:37.660
Yes. Mayama Azusa is someone who ought to be sent to Hell.

00:12:38.110 --> 00:12:41.880
I have not given you the right to pass judgment on people.

00:12:41.880 --> 00:12:45.340
Receiving requests, entering into contracts, and executing them.

00:12:45.340 --> 00:12:46.660
That’s it.

00:12:47.270 --> 00:12:49.160
I can’t accept that.

00:12:49.950 --> 00:12:53.160
Jigoku Shoujo does not need a heart.

00:13:05.950 --> 00:13:09.190
I’ll have you sent to Hell.

00:13:20.710 --> 00:13:22.210
We’ll take her.

00:13:22.210 --> 00:13:23.890
You!

00:13:24.260 --> 00:13:25.500
Hurry, get on!

00:13:25.500 --> 00:13:26.370
Right.

00:13:26.040 --> 00:13:26.370
Yes.

00:13:28.290 --> 00:13:30.080
What are you planning, Ai?

00:13:49.130 --> 00:13:50.720
Why?

00:13:51.470 --> 00:13:53.920
If you do this, you too…!

00:14:05.790 --> 00:14:07.520
Why are you silent?

00:14:37.560 --> 00:14:39.160
No one came.

00:14:41.660 --> 00:14:43.840
You were all alone.

00:14:45.170 --> 00:14:46.160
Yes.

00:14:47.120 --> 00:14:50.570
No one helped us.

00:14:54.230 --> 00:14:55.870
People are weak.

00:14:56.980 --> 00:14:59.910
They always try to protect themselves.

00:15:00.430 --> 00:15:03.180
So they pretend not to see anything.

00:15:05.300 --> 00:15:06.590
What are you talking about?

00:15:24.490 --> 00:15:26.140
That’s different!

00:15:26.140 --> 00:15:28.300
Even if I wanted to, I couldn’t stop them!

00:15:28.300 --> 00:15:30.690
There was nothing I could do!

00:15:30.690 --> 00:15:31.580
That’s why...

00:15:32.600 --> 00:15:34.170
There was no use.

00:15:46.850 --> 00:15:48.110
Yuzuki…

00:16:11.400 --> 00:16:14.380
Jigoku… Shoujo?

00:16:23.790 --> 00:16:26.970
Akie’s father did not pull the string.

00:16:27.930 --> 00:16:29.660
Why do you think he didn’t?

00:16:30.540 --> 00:16:32.070
Take a look.

00:17:22.320 --> 00:17:24.530
I have been looking for you, Yuzuki.

00:17:26.530 --> 00:17:29.310
You have disobeyed the rules.

00:17:29.310 --> 00:17:31.530
You shall suffer the punishment of Hell.

00:17:31.950 --> 00:17:34.130
You are not Akie.

00:17:34.130 --> 00:17:37.530
The Akie I love has already fallen to Hell.

00:17:39.290 --> 00:17:42.300
Disappear, please, disappear!

00:17:48.630 --> 00:17:50.170
Yuzuki.

00:17:53.130 --> 00:17:55.310
I will accept the punishment.

00:18:04.180 --> 00:18:07.380
Hate will never disappear from one’s world.

00:18:07.380 --> 00:18:11.410
You will have to continue your work forever.

00:18:13.580 --> 00:18:17.330
You will never be freed again.

00:18:17.330 --> 00:18:20.020
And you are content with that?

00:18:23.820 --> 00:18:25.120
Ai!

00:18:58.870 --> 00:19:00.280
No!

00:19:01.170 --> 00:19:02.580
It’s alright.

00:19:17.580 --> 00:19:18.760
Yuzuki…

00:19:19.280 --> 00:19:23.290
Ai… why are you…?

00:19:53.840 --> 00:19:57.410
You are me.

00:19:59.610 --> 00:20:00.920
Ai…

00:20:11.610 --> 00:20:14.420
You had a boyfriend, Ai?

00:20:14.420 --> 00:20:18.620
I’m a bit jealous of that.

00:20:24.780 --> 00:20:26.320
Thank you.

00:20:31.980 --> 00:20:33.480
Yuzuki…

00:22:25.210 --> 00:22:26.390
Ojou.

00:22:26.390 --> 00:22:28.670
You’re such an idiot.

00:22:28.670 --> 00:22:32.010
Really, when we thought you would be more relaxed.

00:22:36.100 --> 00:22:39.560
You idiot, Ai! It’s fine if Kikuri’s next!

00:22:40.420 --> 00:22:41.930
Ouch! Why did you do that?

00:22:41.930 --> 00:22:43.960
Why did you, hime?

00:22:46.370 --> 00:22:47.170
Let’s go.

00:22:49.130 --> 00:22:50.190
Yes.

00:23:28.380 --> 00:23:30.890
Tsujino-bashi Takumi-san, right?

00:23:32.000 --> 00:23:33.310
Who are you?

00:23:53.910 --> 00:23:55.390
Hey!

00:23:55.990 --> 00:23:57.400
No!

00:23:58.800 --> 00:23:59.880
Go!

00:24:03.570 --> 00:24:04.820
Run!

00:24:06.890 --> 00:24:09.010
What happened?

00:24:20.750 --> 00:24:25.860
This program is made possible by Sony Music, Aniplex,

00:24:25.860 --> 00:24:29.000
and the listed sponsors.
